            <h3>What is the fastest train from Charlottesville to Baltimore? </h3>

            <p>The fastest option is the Amtrak Northeast Regional, which can complete the journey in approximately 3 hours 15 minutes with direct service and minimal delays. </p>


            <h3>How much does a train cost from Charlottesville to Baltimore? </h3>

